{
  "apiVersion": "silo-standard/v0",
  "metadata": {
    "id": "plans",
    "version": "0.8.2",
    "name": "Plans",
    "description": "Shared plans that agents and humans carry out together (team-plan): one file per plan, tasks with dependencies, mixed owners, notes and the conversations that work them"
  },
  "spec": {
    "producer": {
      "role": "any-agent",
      "via": "skill team-plan",
      "instructions": {
        "summary": "The team-plan skill is this silo's producing half and the ONLY source of task conduct (who takes what, when it is released, how to ask and wait, when a human's task closes: on that person's word or with the evidence in the system, written in the note). Here only the FORMAT of plans/<slug>.plan.json, for every agent; the wake protocol reaches only the agents bound to the «Task mode» silo.",
        "protocol": [
          "States: pending | in_progress | in_review | blocked | done | cancelled. Only done resolves a dependency: a cancelled blocker never resolves it.",
          "blocked = an unfinished dependency (dependsOn) or a declared wait: waitingOn {owner, action, asked?, options?} — asked is the question in words; options, 1 to 4 answers of up to 40 characters when the answer is a choice.",
          "in_review = done, waiting for someone to review it: an agent's task in in_review names its reviewer with waitingOn {owner, action, asked} — the owner, a person or another agent, never its own owner. nextCheckAt is not a reviewer. Without a reviewer the task is stuck (review-without-reviewer) and a release with \"state\": \"in_review\" is refused (409).",
          "parent groups subtasks and does NOT block: if the parent really waits on the child, declare it in dependsOn.",
          "notes[] is append-only ({at, by, text}); a note is never rewritten or deleted. A note in another shape (a string) is not read: the task shows as unreadable.",
          "conversations[] lists the sessions that worked the task (strings or {session} objects; a loose conversation is not read). releases[] is append-only: {session, released, at, by}; the last mark of each thread, by position, decides whether it is current (no marks or released: false) or history (released: true). Silos's claim and release write it; the manual fallback (Silos doesn't answer) adds the id to conversations[] and, only if that thread's last mark is released: true, {\"session\": \"<id>\", \"released\": false, \"at\": \"<ISO>\", \"by\": \"<you>\"}.",
          "nextCheckAt (ISO date-time): when its owner looks at it again.",
          "Dropped: an abandoned task is cancelled with a note that starts 'Dropped:' — it is never deleted and does NOT resolve dependencies: whatever depended on it stays blocked until someone removes or changes that dependency (the owner does it from the dependent's page: remove the dependency, or reopen the dropped one). On screen the cancelled state reads «dropped», with or without a note; the state says it, never the note.",
          "The project's list: plans/tasks.plan.json (a reserved name) — born as {\"title\": \"\", \"tasks\": []} (the empty title is on purpose), always active, never moved or archived. Its tasks are named by the project: <project>#t3. Tasks done or cancelled before this month (UTC) that no open task names in dependsOn/parent move to plans/closed/tasks-YYYY-MM.plan.json; their ids stay in retired[] and are not reused. A finished named plan → plans/closed/. No plan is named like its project's folder."
        ]
      }
    },
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "plans",
        "type": "files",
        "root": "project",
        "glob": "plans/*.plan.json",
        "parser": "json",
        "expects": {
          "producer": "agent"
        }
      }
    ],
    "kinds": {
      "plan": {
        "envelope": {
          "id": {
            "from": "filename"
          },
          "identity": {
            "template": "{{title}}"
          },
          "state": {
            "computed": "id != 'tasks' and any(tasks, state in [done, cancelled]) and all(tasks, state in [done, cancelled]) ? done : active"
          },
          "at": {
            "field": "updatedAt",
            "mayBeEmpty": true
          },
          "anchors": [
            {
              "hub": "folder",
              "from": "location"
            }
          ],
          "updatedBy": {
            "absent": "unknown"
          }
        },
        "states": [
          {
            "value": "active",
            "label": {
              "one": "active",
              "many": "active"
            }
          },
          {
            "value": "done",
            "label": {
              "one": "done",
              "many": "done"
            },
            "terminal": true
          }
        ],
        "fields": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "required": true
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "timestamp",
            "optional": true
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "timestamp",
            "optional": true
          }
        },
        "unknownFields": "preserve",
        "subKinds": {
          "task": {
            "path": "tasks[]",
            "envelope": {
              "id": {
                "field": "id"
              },
              "identity": {
                "template": "{{title}}"
              },
              "state": {
                "field": "status"
              },
              "at": {
                "inherit": "parent.at"
              },
              "updatedBy": {
                "absent": "unknown"
              }
            },
            "states": [
              {
                "value": "pending",
                "label": {
                  "one": "pending",
                  "many": "pending"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "in_progress",
                "label": {
                  "one": "in progress",
                  "many": "in progress"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "in_review",
                "label": {
                  "one": "in review",
                  "many": "in review"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "blocked",
                "label": {
                  "one": "blocked",
                  "many": "blocked"
                }
              },
              {
                "value": "done",
                "label": {
                  "one": "done",
                  "many": "done"
                },
                "terminal": true
              },
              {
                "value": "cancelled",
                "label": {
                  "one": "dropped",
                  "many": "dropped"
                },
                "terminal": true
              }
            ],
            "roles": {
              "task": {
                "owner": "owner",
                "dependsOn": "dependsOn",
                "waitingOn": "waitingOn",
                "nextCheckAt": "nextCheckAt",
                "conversations": "conversations",
                "releases": "releases"
              },
              "due": {
                "field": "due"
              }
            },
            "fields": {
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "required": true
              },
              "owner": {
                "type": "actor",
                "required": true
              },
              "dependsOn": {
                "type": "refs(task)",
                "withinParent": true
              },
              "parent": {
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              },
              "waitingOn": {
                "type": "object",
                "optional": true
              },
              "nextCheckAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              },
              "due": {
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              },
              "source": {
                "type": "path",
                "optional": true
              },
              "short": {
                "type": "string",
                "optional": true
              },
              "createdBy": { "type": "string", "optional": true },
              "origin": { "type": "string", "optional": true },
              "signal": { "type": "string", "optional": true },
              "run": { "type": "string", "optional": true }
            },
            "computed": {
              "ready": "state in [pending, in_progress, blocked] and all(dependsOn, state = done) and waiting = false"
            },
            "subKinds": {
              "note": {
                "path": "notes[]",
                "appendOnly": true,
                "writeMerge": "union(at,by,text) ordered by at",
                "envelope": {
                  "identity": {
                    "template": "{{text}}"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "field": "at",
                    "mayBeEmpty": true
                  },
                  "updatedBy": {
                    "field": "by"
                  }
                },
                "fields": {
                  "text": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "required": true,
                    "max": 8000
                  }
                }
              },
              "conversation": {
                "path": "conversations[]",
                "envelope": {
                  "id": {
                    "field": "session"
                  },
                  "identity": {
                    "template": "{{session}}"
                  }
                },
                "fields": {
                  "session": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "required": true
                  }
                },
                "lift": {
                  "when": "a session as a string",
                  "synthesize": {
                    "session": "{{the string}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "release": {
                "path": "releases[]",
                "appendOnly": true,
                "envelope": {
                  "identity": {
                    "template": "{{session}}"
                  },
                  "at": {
                    "field": "at",
                    "mayBeEmpty": true
                  },
                  "updatedBy": {
                    "field": "by"
                  }
                },
                "fields": {
                  "session": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "required": true
                  },
                  "released": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "required": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "_file": "august-close.plan.json",
            "title": "August books close",
            "createdAt": "2026-08-25",
            "updatedAt": "2026-08-27",
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "title": "Export the month's sales",
                "owner": "finance",
                "status": "done",
                "dependsOn": [],
                "conversations": [
                  "6ad8e4db-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "title": "Confirm the figure with the accountant",
                "owner": "sam",
                "status": "pending",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "t1"
                ],
                "notes": [
                  {
                    "at": "2026-08-26T09:00:00Z",
                    "by": "finance",
                    "text": "Before the 28th"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "title": "Close the month in the ERP",
                "owner": "finance",
                "status": "blocked",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "t2"
                ],
                "notes": [
                  {
                    "at": "2026-08-26T09:05:00Z",
                    "by": "finance",
                    "text": "Waits for the figure from t2"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_file": "launch.plan.json",
            "title": "Launch",
            "createdAt": "2026-10-30",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-02",
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "title": "Write the page",
                "owner": "writer",
                "status": "in_review",
                "dependsOn": [],
                "waitingOn": {
                  "owner": "sam",
                  "action": "review the page",
                  "asked": "Do we publish this version?"
                },
                "conversations": [
                  "9d99c98d-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"
                ],
                "notes": [
                  {
                    "at": "2026-11-02T10:00:00Z",
                    "by": "writer",
                    "text": "Done; needs sam's OK. Next: sam reviews."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "title": "OK to publish",
                "owner": "sam",
                "status": "pending",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "t1"
                ],
                "due": "2026-11-06"
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "title": "Translate",
                "owner": "writer",
                "status": "blocked",
                "dependsOn": [],
                "parent": "t1",
                "waitingOn": {
                  "owner": "ana",
                  "action": "send the glossary"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "title": "Video version",
                "owner": "writer",
                "status": "cancelled",
                "dependsOn": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_file": "plan-with-drop.plan.json",
            "title": "Plan with a dropped task",
            "updatedAt": "2026-09-02",
            "context": "free-form tail fields (context, spec, deadline…) are preserved",
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "title": "Spike of option A",
                "owner": "writer",
                "status": "cancelled",
                "dependsOn": [],
                "notes": [
                  {
                    "at": "2026-08-30T10:00:00Z",
                    "by": "writer",
                    "text": "Started 30-08"
                  },
                  {
                    "at": "2026-09-01T12:00:00Z",
                    "by": "owner",
                    "text": "Dropped: superseded by option B (owner, 01-09)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "board",
        "archetype": "board",
        "kind": "plan/task",
        "groupBy": "state",
        "swimBy": "parent",
        "fold": {
          "when": "parent.at < now - 30d"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "plans",
        "archetype": "list",
        "kind": "plan",
        "columns": [
          "identity",
          "state",
          "at",
          "folder"
        ],
        "fold": {
          "when": "state = done"
        }
      }
    ],
    "surfaces": {
      "pulse": {
        "kind": "plan/task",
        "aggregate": "count",
        "when": "ready and owner = 'owner'",
        "label": {
          "one": "task yours to do",
          "many": "tasks yours to do"
        }
      },
      "needs-you": [
        {
          "when": "ready and owner is human and owner != 'owner' and gate",
          "urgency": "due",
          "clears": "state in [done, cancelled]",
          "actions": [
            "open",
            "set-field",
            "append-item"
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": "ready and owner = 'owner' and (gate or due < now + 7d)",
          "urgency": "due",
          "clears": "state in [done, cancelled]",
          "actions": [
            "open",
            "set-field",
            "append-item"
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": "ready and owner = 'owner'",
          "urgency": "routine",
          "clears": "state in [done, cancelled]",
          "actions": [
            "open",
            "set-field",
            "append-item"
          ],
          "fold": {
            "when": "parent.at < now - 30d"
          }
        },
        {
          "when": "waitsOnHuman",
          "urgency": "due",
          "clears": "state in [done, cancelled]",
          "actions": [
            "open",
            "append-item"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "project-machinery": {
        "label": "Plans"
      }
    },
    "actions": [
      {
        "verb": "set-field",
        "subKind": "plan/task",
        "fields": {
          "status": {
            "writableBy": "owner"
          },
          "dependsOn": {
            "writableBy": "owner"
          },
          "nextCheckAt": {
            "writableBy": "owner",
            "clearable": true
          },
          "waitingOn": {
            "writableBy": "owner",
            "clearable": true
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "verb": "append-item",
        "subKind": "plan/task",
        "by": [
          "owner",
          "producer"
        ]
      },
      {
        "verb": "append-item",
        "subKind": "plan/task/note",
        "by": [
          "owner",
          "producer"
        ]
      },
      {
        "verb": "append-item",
        "subKind": "plan/task/conversation",
        "by": [
          "owner"
        ]
      },
      {
        "verb": "claim",
        "subKind": "plan/task",
        "link": "conversations",
        "set": {
          "status": "in_progress"
        },
        "by": [
          "owner",
          "task-owner"
        ],
        "keep": [
          "blocked"
        ]
      },
      {
        "verb": "release",
        "subKind": "plan/task",
        "link": "releases",
        "by": [
          "owner",
          "task-owner"
        ],
        "dispose": {
          "field": "status",
          "from": "in_progress",
          "default": "pending",
          "allowed": [
            "pending",
            "in_review",
            "blocked",
            "done",
            "cancelled"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "verb": "ensure-record",
        "kind": "plan",
        "id": "tasks",
        "by": [
          "owner"
        ],
        "seed": {
          "title": "",
          "tasks": []
        },
        "rotate": {
          "children": "tasks",
          "when": "(state = done and since(done) < monthStart) or (state = cancelled and since(cancelled) < monthStart)",
          "keepReferencedBy": [
            "dependsOn",
            "parent"
          ],
          "every": "month",
          "stamp": "rotatedAt",
          "retired": "retired",
          "into": "plans/closed/tasks-{{month}}.plan.json",
          "undated": "old"
        }
      },
      {
        "verb": "agent-record-write",
        "kind": "plan",
        "by": "producer"
      },
      {
        "verb": "open"
      },
      {
        "verb": "ack"
      }
    ]
  }
}
